 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "I couldn't start onboarding for Maria Lopez yet. A search of the company directory for \"Maria Lopez\", \"Lopez\" and \"Maria\" returned no records, and onboarding can only start for a new hire who already has a directory record with status pre_start. HR needs to create that record first.\n\nOnce HR has created it, send me the employee ID (or confirm the record exists) and I can start onboarding. Under POL-ONB-01, onboarding can start no earlier than 5 business days before the start date. For a 1 December start, that means it can begin from Monday 24 November. Onboarding creates email, team chat and HR portal accounts, the Operations standard system (TMS), and a laptop due the business day before the start date. Any other system access has to be requested separately after onboarding has started.\n\nPlease ask HR to create Maria's pre_start record. If you'd like, I can send HR a note on your behalf now.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ONB-01"
 ]
}
